WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
Simulated demo: Arthur receives a portfolio review brief for three fictional companies.

00:10.000 --> 00:22.000
Research workstreams run in parallel and retain evidence for each observation.

00:22.000 --> 00:32.000
Arthur prioritizes example findings and proposes changes. Security concerns require authorized validation.

00:32.000 --> 00:48.000
Arthur prepares proposed code changes and opens a fictional website preview. Nothing is deployed.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
A form-label check needs repair. Arthur applies a correction and reruns validation.

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
The portfolio brief, concepts, evidence register, and execution record are ready for human review.
